{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile settings using the scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275, higher than previous singleprofile configurations. The results suggest multiprofile may improve performance with the scvi_n200 encoder, though the role of aggregation (avgpool) and fusion strategies remains uncertain without direct comparisons."
}

